  "answer": "Only a small numerical long-context lead, not a newly established material lane win. Both arms retrieve exactly at 130,048 tokens. Upstream takes 57.416 s versus shipped 58.154 s and prefills at 2275.6 versus 2242.0 tok/s (+1.50%); EXP-048 already showed a +1.20% upstream prefill lead, and e31bc99b is only +0.29% above that earlier upstream prefill result. Current upstream decode is 59.20/59.22 rounds/s on the gate/thinking-off prompts versus shipped 72.46/72.44, about 18.3% slower. Upstream still reuses 0/4 fanout branches versus 4/4 shipped and loses reuse on 4/8 two-session continuations versus 2/8 shipped. Both pass the live-sibling/delete/survivor protocol. All requested gates completed with zero request errors. The optional operation benchmark failed before collecting any timing; production was restored immediately.",
