    "next": "For attribution, first select a Q5 public-Linear shape/T supported by both benchmark registries, or use the matching fused-operation benchmark; the attempted primer was unsupported. Then isolate linear/GDN/synchronization contributions in a separate approved window if needed. No second production window was opened for optional attribution.",
